  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Statens revisionsverk i Tanzania f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra          offentlig redovisningsskyldighet och finansiell disciplin i alla      offentliga institutioner f&#xf6;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla transparens och          ansvarsskyldighet i den offentliga inkomster och utgifter.            Ytterligare teknisk support tillhandah&#xe5;lls av den svenska             Riksrevisionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the National audit Office in Tanzania to enhance public    accountability and financial discipline throughout all public         institutions to ensure transparancy and accountability in public      revenue and expenditure. Additional technical support is provided by  the swedish national audit office.</narrative>
  </description>
